~Inevitable Cataclysm~.Effect:
You declare war on your enemy, and wait for the perfect moment to obliterate them.

Choose a Unit you can see. At the start of your next Turn, you jump to them and strike them with your weapon for 5d12 Damage of your weapon's type. The impact ripples to Units within 5 meters, and each Unit caught takes 1 die less of the result per meter away from the main target. The Quest Master chooses which die to drop per meter.

{Teal('After Targeted Damage:')} 
{Teal('After Heal:')}

~Knight's Corral~.Effect:
You make your surrounding area impossible to tresspass, except for your challenger of choice.

Choose a Worthy Enemy. All other Units within 4 meters of either of you are Slammed 5d4 meters away from between you. Until the start of your next Turn, no other Units can willingly come within 3 meters of either of you, and for the rest of the Combat, you both Heal for 200% of the Round number at the start of each Worthy Round.

{Teal('After Mass Damage:')} 
{Teal('After Targeted Damage:')}

~Liege's Banner~.Effect:
You detach your banner, and raise it above the battlefield, ready to throw it.

Throw your special banner onto a place on the battlefield, dealing 3d6 Pierce Damage to Units within 1 meter of its landing point and Healing the thrower for 1d8. The banner has 15 Max Health and absorbs all Damage the Knight's allies take.

