~Sovereign Execution~.Effect:
You prepare to decimate the meak and using their life force as fuel for your conquest.

Your next attack charges you up to 5 meters towards the target, and heals you for all the Damage done. If it leaves the non-Epic Unit with 25% or less Health, further deals extra Damage equal to its current Health and the Damage type becomes True.

